  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">United for the forest Peru: strengthening agents of change</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main purpose of this project is to strengthen capacities and knowledge of national, regional and local decision-makers, journalists, communicators, influencers, artists and the general public about the challenges, opportunities and consequences for development in the Peruvian Amazon. In this way, it will position deforestation and degradation of Amazonian ecosystems motivated by various economic development activities in the national debate.</narrative>
  </description>
